                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./260:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Venezuela</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cook</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-02-18T17:00:00-04:30">February 18, 1929—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. Your 9, February 14, 11 a.m.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d337-f1"/> Permission to
                    effect survey flights granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cook</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
